flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> OPEN[User opens ReadTrack]
    OPEN --> AUTH{Authenticated?}
    AUTH -- No --> CREDS[Enter Credentials]
    CREDS --> SUPAAUTH[Authenticate via Supabase Auth]
    SUPAAUTH --> VALID{Valid Credentials?}
    VALID -- No --> ERR[Show Error Message] --> STOP1([End])
    VALID -- Yes --> DASH
    AUTH -- Yes --> DASH[Display Dashboard<br/>Grade 7 Reading Complexity & Proficiency Tracker]

    DASH --> ACTION{Select Action}

    %% ══════════════════════════════
    %%  STUDENT GRADING
    %% ══════════════════════════════
    ACTION -- Student Grading --> INTYPE{Input Method}
    INTYPE -- Type/Paste --> ESSAYTEXT[Enter essay text directly]
    INTYPE -- Upload Image --> IMGOCR[Gemini Vision OCR<br/>extract text]
    INTYPE -- Upload PDF --> PDFEXT[pypdf — extract text]
    ESSAYTEXT & IMGOCR & PDFEXT --> SUBMIT[Submit essay for analysis]

    SUBMIT --> DETECT[Detect Language<br/>English or Filipino]
    SUBMIT --> FEATS[Extract 30-Dimensional<br/>Linguistic Feature Vector<br/>vocabulary · syntax · readability<br/>CEFR groups · discourse connectors<br/>passive voice · modals · negation<br/>abstract nouns · subordination]
    SUBMIT --> GRAMMAR[Check Grammar & Spelling<br/>LanguageTool + SymSpellPy]

    DETECT & FEATS & GRAMMAR --> LANGQ{Language is Filipino?}
    LANGQ -- Yes --> CALAM[Process with calamanCy<br/>POS tagging · NER · dependency]
    LANGQ -- No --> SPACY[Process with spaCy en_core_web_sm]

    CALAM & SPACY --> SVMP[Classify Writing Level SVM<br/>Nagsisimula / Papaunlad / Mahusay]
    CALAM & SPACY --> SVMC[Classify Text Complexity SVM<br/>Literal / Inferential / Evaluative]
    CALAM & SPACY --> READ[Compute Readability Scores<br/>Flesch-Kincaid · Gunning Fog]

    SVMP & SVMC & READ --> AIFEED[Generate AI Rubric Feedback<br/>Gemini 2.5 Flash]
    AIFEED --> DISP[Display Results<br/>writing level · complexity · grammar<br/>readability scores · AI feedback]

    DISP --> SAVEQ{Save analysis?}
    SAVEQ -- Yes --> SUPA1[Save to Supabase<br/>student_grading_uploads]
    SUPA1 --> DBUPDATE[Dashboard updated]
    SAVEQ -- No --> NEXTACTION1[ ]

    %% ══════════════════════════════
    %%  MATERIAL LIBRARY
    %% ══════════════════════════════
    ACTION -- Material Library --> MATACTION{Action}
    MATACTION -- Upload Material --> MATUP[Upload text, image, or PDF]
    MATUP --> MATEXT[Extract text content]
    MATEXT --> MATLANG[Detect Language<br/>detectLanguageAPI → eng or fil]
    MATEXT --> MATFEAT[Extract 30-dim linguistic features]
    MATFEAT --> MATSVM[Classify complexity via SVM<br/>Literal / Inferential / Evaluative]
    MATLANG & MATSVM --> MODAL[Show confirmation modal<br/>'Is this recommendation good?'<br/>Accept model suggestion / Override]
    MODAL --> TEACHQ{Teacher accepts?}
    TEACHQ -- Yes --> SAVEMODELEVEL[Save with model-assigned level]
    TEACHQ -- No --> TEACHLEVEL[Teacher picks level manually]
    SAVEMODELEVEL & TEACHLEVEL --> SUPA2[Persist material + language tag<br/>material_uploads in Supabase]

    MATACTION -- Browse & Filter --> LOADMATS[Load materials from Supabase]
    LOADMATS --> LANGPAR[Detect language for all materials<br/>parallel Promise.all]
    LANGPAR --> FILTLANG[Filter by Language<br/>All / English / Filipino]
    FILTLANG --> FILTLEVEL[Filter by Complexity Level]
    FILTLEVEL --> MATVIEW[View material card — G7 suitability<br/>Phil-IRI level · vocabulary breakdown]

    %% ══════════════════════════════
    %%  GRAMMAR CHECKER
    %% ══════════════════════════════
    ACTION -- Grammar Checker --> GTEXT[Enter or paste text]
    GTEXT --> LTOOL[LanguageTool<br/>grammar & punctuation rules]
    GTEXT --> SYMSP[SymSpellPy<br/>fast dictionary spell check]
    LTOOL & SYMSP --> AIGRAMMAR[Enhance with Gemini AI<br/>context-aware corrections]
    AIGRAMMAR --> GINLINE[Display issues with inline highlights]
    GINLINE --> GSUGG[Show suggestions and replacements]

    %% ══════════════════════════════
    %%  DASHBOARD & ANALYTICS
    %% ══════════════════════════════
    ACTION -- Dashboard --> COMPLEXDIST[View Grade 7 Complexity Distribution]
    COMPLEXDIST --> PROFDIST[View Student Proficiency Distribution]
    PROFDIST --> METRICS[View essay and material metrics]
    METRICS --> QUICKNAV[Access quick-action navigation]

    DBUPDATE & NEXTACTION1 & SUPA2 & MATVIEW & GSUGG & QUICKNAV --> STOP2([End])
